{"shortDescription":"Asia's diesel price movements were volatile this week as markets weighed a potential US diesel export ban while October spot negotiations from regional refiners stayed brisk, though cash premiums and margins slipped to two-week lows.At least two northeast Asian refiners sold off their October cargo…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Asia's diesel price movements were volatile this week as markets weighed a potential US diesel export ban while October spot negotiations from regional refiners stayed brisk, though cash premiums and margins slipped to two-week lows."]},{"type":"p","children":["At least two northeast Asian refiners sold off their October cargoes at slight premiums, while there were talks of offers from China as well."]},{"type":"p","children":["China's diesel exports are still likely to remain stable in October compared with September, according to several trade and analyst sources."]},{"type":"p","children":["Refining margins (GO10SGCKMc1) eased back to two-week lows of around $68.70 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cash differentials (GO10-SIN-DIF) inched down to around $3 a barrel, continuing to hover at two-week low levels."]},{"type":"p","children":["Discussions in the jet fuel market also ticked up, with China-origin barrels also on offer, though price levels were in a wide range of slight discounts to slight premiums."]},{"type":"p","children":["Regrade (JETREG10SGMc1) narrowed slightly to discounts of around $3 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["SINGAPORE CASH DEALS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- No deal for gasoil or jet fuel"]},{"type":"p","children":["INVENTORIES"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Gasoline stocks independently held in the Amsterdam-Rotterdam-Antwerp (ARA) refining and storage hub fell 3.4% on the week, data from Dutch consultancy Insights Global showed on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["REFINERY NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Russia's air defence units destroyed about 50 drones over the Rostov region overnight, and a drone attack damaged the Novoshakhtinsk oil refinery, forcing it to suspend operations temporarily, governor Yuri Slyusar said on Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Saudi Arabia is building up crude-pumping volumes through its East-West Pipeline that runs to its Red Sea export hub of Yanbu, although crude tanker loadings have yet to resume, according to industry sources, satellite imagery and shipping data."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Ship-to-ship transfers in the Gulf of Oman for Middle Eastern oil from inside the Strait of Hormuz have reached their limits after Saudi Arabia diverted exports from the Red Sea, adding to shipments from other producers, trade sources and analysts said."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Crude oil flows out of the Strait of Hormuz reached 33.7 million barrels so far in the week starting September 20, preliminary ship-tracking data from Kpler showed on Friday, putting exports roughly on track with the previous week's levels."]},{"type":"p","children":["- High-level contacts between the European Union and the United States are ongoing amid a reported US plan to ban diesel exports that the EU believes would potentially have a negative impact on both sides, a European Commission spokesperson said on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["PRICES"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["MIDDLE DISTILLATES"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CASH ($/BBL)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ASIA CLOSE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Change"]}]},